  <h1>2027, café by café</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ n.top3[0] }}, {{ n.top3[1] }} and {{ n.top3[2] }} deliver {{ n.top3_share | pct(0, False) }} of the {{ n.growth_total | fm }} of growth. {{ n.slowest[0].store }} ({{ n.slowest[0].growth | pct }}) and {{ n.slowest[1].store }} ({{ n.slowest[1].growth | pct }}) grow the least.</p>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col" style="flex:1.45">
      <table class="roomy">
        <thead><tr><th class="l">Café</th><th class="l">Region</th><th>2025<br>actual</th><th>2026<br>estimate</th><th>2027 best<br>estimate</th><th>vs<br>2026</th>{% if P %}<th>2027<br>plan</th>{% endif %}<th>Model range<br>(low–high)</th>{% if not P %}<th>Share<br>of 2027</th>{% endif %}</tr></thead>
        <tbody>
